628
28:19.350 --> 28:20.240
You are not ready

629
28:20.240 --> 28:22.000
to sacrifice for a great cause.

630
28:22.910 --> 28:24.440
You fear sacrifice.

631
28:25.330 --> 28:27.330
This fear has affected your morale.

632
28:37.000 --> 28:39.560
I have reason to believe

633
28:39.590 --> 28:43.440
